<title>USA: Austin ISD, Texas won by Lehman Brothers.</title>
<headline>Austin ISD, Texas won by Lehman Brothers.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers said it won $110 million of Austin Ind Sch Dist, Texas, school building general olbigation bonds, Series 1997, with a true interest cost of 5.1090 percent.</p>
